{"candidates":[],"candidates_truncated":false,"canonical_status":"canonical","citations":[],"contract_version":"2","descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:4882","original":"A [[Vocaloid]] originally released for the VOCALOID2 engine on January 30, 2009. She was the third of the Character Vocal Series and is an official [[Piapro Studio|PIAPRO]] character.\r\n\r\nShe is voiced by [[Asakawa Yuu]]. Her appearance was illustrated by [[KEI (Keigarou)|]]. She has [[long hair|long]] [[pink hair]] and [[blue eyes]]. She wears a golden [[headset]], a black [[crop top]], [[brown armband]]s, a [[yellow sleeves|yellow]] [[single detached sleeve]] on her right arm, a [[long skirt]] with a [[side slit]], [[black thighhighs]], and [[gold boots|gold]] [[lace-up boots|lace-up]] [[knee boots]]. She also has a golden [[chest jewel]] in shape of a [[trumpet]]'s [[valve|valves]] and the [[infinity symbol]].\r\n\r\nh4. Appearance\r\n\r\n* !post #4646426: VOCALOID2\r\n* !post #2003104: [[Megurine Luka (Vocaloid4)|Vocaloid4]]\r\n* !asset #49805347: [[Megurine Luka (SP)|SP]]\r\n* !post #11295407: [[Project Sekai]]\r\n\r\nh4. Derivatives\r\n\r\nh6. Voicebanks\r\n\r\n* [[Megurine Luka (SP)]]\r\n* [[Megurine Luka (Vocaloid4)]]\r\n\r\nh6. [[Project Diva]]\r\n\r\n* [[Megurine Luka (Amour)]]\r\n* [[Megurine Luka (Cabin Attendant)]]\r\n* [[Megurine Luka (Chiffon Dress)]]\r\n* [[Megurine Luka (Conflict)]]\r\n* [[Megurine Luka (Cybernation)]]\r\n* [[Megurine Luka (Dominant Stone)]]\r\n* [[Megurine Luka (Eternal White)]]\r\n* [[Megurine Luka (Floral)]]\r\n* [[Megurine Luka (Fraulein)]]\r\n* [[Megurine Luka (Hana)]]\r\n* [[Megurine Luka (Hard Rock)]]\r\n* [[Megurine Luka (Houkago Mode)]]\r\n* [[Megurine Luka (Ivy Moulin)]]\r\n* [[Megurine Luka (Kougyoku)]]\r\n* [[Megurine Luka (Logicalist)]]\r\n* [[Megurine Luka (Nekomimi Parka)]]\r\n* [[Megurine Luka (Racing Swimsuit)]]\r\n* [[Megurine Luka (Recruiter)]]\r\n* 